cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its annotations in your research, please cite the preprint using the metadata below."
title: "Constraint-Aware Traffic Intervention Visualization Using Multi-Label Road-Marking Recognition"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/KingFarooq/TrafficCongestionWithAI"

authors:
  - family-names: Anwar
    given-names: Farooq M.

abstract: >-
  A research prototype combining multi-label road-marking recognition,
  survey-based congestion categorization, constraint-filtered intervention
  ranking, and schematic visualization. The system is a proof of concept
  and is not a validated traffic-management system.

